{
  "label": "Action Request",
  "category": "Alert Issuer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Managing Action Request",
      "id": "action-request",
      "intro": "Action Request digunakan untuk escalate alert atau request tindakan ke tim lain. Support multiple priority level dan tracking status real-time.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuat Action Request",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Dari detail alert, klik tombol **Action Request**\n• Dialog akan muncul dengan form:\n  - Priority: HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n  - Action Type: Block Card / Contact Customer / Escalate\n  - Description: Detail request\n  - Assign To: Team atau user tujuan\n• Klik **Submit** untuk create request",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eff6ff,#fff);\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#2563eb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Create Action Request</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Priority</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">HIGH</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">MEDIUM</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">LOW</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Action Type</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;\">Block Card</div></div><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:7px;background:#3b82f6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;width:100%;\">Submit Request</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Priority Level Explained",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **HIGH** — Urgent action, target response 1-2 jam\n  - Block account / card\n  - Stop transaction immediately\n  - Large fraud amount\n• **MEDIUM** — Standard escalation, target 4-8 jam\n  - Contact customer for verification\n  - Moderate risk case\n• **LOW** — Non-urgent, target 1-2 hari\n  - Information request\n  - Low risk verification",
          "color": "#dc2626",
          "bg": "#fef2f2",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fecaca;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef2f2,#fee2e2);border-left:3px solid #dc2626;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;text-transform:uppercase;\">🚨 HIGH Priority</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">⏱️ 1-2 hrs</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Block card, stop transaction, large fraud</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;text-transform:uppercase;\">⚠️ MEDIUM Priority</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">⏱️ 4-8 hrs</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Contact customer, moderate risk</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;text-transform:uppercase;\">ℹ️ LOW Priority</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">⏱️ 1-2 days</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Info request, low risk verification</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Track Request Status",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Status request:\n  - **PENDING** — Menunggu diproses\n  - **IN PROGRESS** — Sedang ditangani\n  - **COMPLETED** — Selesai diproses\n  - **REJECTED** — Ditolak dengan alasan\n• Notifikasi otomatis saat status berubah\n• Timeline activity untuk tracking history",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Request Status</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">⏳ PENDING</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Waiting...</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">🔄 IN PROGRESS</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Processing...</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ COMPLETED</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Done</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "View Request Details",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik action request untuk lihat detail\n• Detail mencakup:\n  - Request info (ID, priority, type)\n  - Requester & assignee\n  - Timeline activity\n  - Response/Result dari assignee\n  - Related alert information\n• Bisa add comment untuk follow-up",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Request Details</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Request ID</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">REQ-2024-00123</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">From</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Sarah Analyst</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">To</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Supervisor Team</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Timeline</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Created: 10:00 AM<br>Assigned: 10:05 AM<br>In Progress: 10:30 AM</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Search & Filter Requests",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tab **Action Request** di halaman utama\n• Filter tersedia:\n  - Status: Pending / In Progress / Completed\n  - Priority: High / Medium / Low\n  - Date Range\n  - Requester / Assignee\n• Search by request ID atau related alert ID\n• Export data untuk reporting",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdfa;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14b8a6,#0d9488);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Search & Filter</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ Completed</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Pending</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">In Progress</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">HIGH</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">MEDIUM</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">LOW</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
